#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "July 2026 {#july-2026}"
msgstr "Hulyo 2026 {#july-2026}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "New pre-flight checks and new `backend` methods in Qiskit Functions v0.17.0: New methods in `qiskit-ibm-catalog` let you check runtime capacity and backend access before you run, and `run()` now validates both before it submits a job.\n"
msgstr "Mga bagong pre-flight check at bagong `backend` na mga method sa Qiskit Functions v0.17.0: Ang mga bagong method sa `qiskit-ibm-catalog` ay nagbibigay-daan sa iyo na tsekan ang runtime capacity at backend access bago tumakbo, at ngayon ay i-validate ng `run()` ang pareho bago mag-submit ng job.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**What's new**\n"
msgstr "**Ano ang bago**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you call `run()` on a function, the service checks three things first: that your instance has runtime capacity, that you can reach the backend you named, and that at least one backend is available. If something is wrong, you get a clear error right away instead of waiting in the queue.\n"
msgstr "Kapag tinawag mo ang `run()` sa isang function, tsinetsek muna ng serbisyo ang tatlong bagay: kung may runtime capacity ang iyong instance, kung maaabot mo ang backend na pinangalanan mo, at kung may kahit isang backend na available. Kung may mali, agad kang makakakuha ng malinaw na error sa halip na maghintay sa queue.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "      You can also check these resources yourself, at any time:\n"
msgstr "      Maaari mo ring tsekan ang mga resource na ito mismo, anumang oras:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check your remaining runtime capacity with `usage()`.\n"
msgstr "Tsekan ang natitira mong runtime capacity gamit ang `usage()`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "List the backends your instance can reach with `backends()`.\n"
msgstr "Ilista ang mga backend na maaabot ng iyong instance gamit ang `backends()`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Look up a single backend and confirm access with `backend()`.\n"
msgstr "Hanapin ang isang backend at kumpirmahin ang access gamit ang `backend()`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find the backend with the fewest pending jobs with `least_busy()`.\n"
msgstr "Hanapin ang backend na may pinakakaunting pending jobs gamit ang `least_busy()`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Common use cases**\n"
msgstr "**Mga karaniwang use case**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check your remaining capacity before a long batch of jobs, and skip the run if there is not enough left to finish it.\n"
msgstr "Tsekan ang natitira mong capacity bago ang mahabang batch ng jobs, at laktawan ang run kung hindi sapat ang natitira para matapos ito.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a backend in code instead of hard-coding a name.\n"
msgstr "Pumili ng backend sa code sa halip na mag-hard-code ng pangalan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fail fast in pipelines and notebooks instead of waiting in the queue.\n"
msgstr "Mabilis na mag-fail sa mga pipeline at notebook sa halip na maghintay sa queue.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Get started**\n"
msgstr "**Magsimula**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "First ensure you're running the latest version of `qiskit-ibm-catalog`:\n"
msgstr "Una, siguraduhing pinapatakbo mo ang pinakabagong bersyon ng `qiskit-ibm-catalog`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```bash\n"
"      pip install --upgrade qiskit-ibm-catalog\n"
"      ```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Then see the [documentation](/guides/functions-get-started) for more information and an example.\n"
msgstr "Pagkatapos, tingnan ang [dokumentasyon](/guides/functions-get-started) para sa karagdagang impormasyon at halimbawa.\n"

