#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Functions templates provide you with a modular pipeline that allows you to swap in new tools, methods, or configurations for your own custom experiments. All function templates are also readily deployable to [Qiskit Serverless](/guides/serverless), where you can easily leverage classical compute as part of running your workflow. You can deploy your serverless package on your preferred cloud environment, or take advantage of the hosted service provided by IBM for Premium and Flex Plan users. Regardless of which option you choose, Qiskit Serverless helps to simplify execution and parallelize portions of your workflow.\n"
msgstr "Nagbibigay ang mga template ng Qiskit Functions ng modular pipeline na nagbibigay-daan sa iyong palitan ang mga bagong tool, method, o configuration para sa sarili mong custom na eksperimento. Lahat ng function template ay madaling i-deploy din sa [Qiskit Serverless](/guides/serverless), kung saan madali mong magagamit ang classical compute bilang bahagi ng pagpapatakbo ng iyong workflow. Maaari mong i-deploy ang iyong serverless package sa gusto mong cloud environment, o samantalahin ang hosted service na ibinibigay ng IBM para sa mga user ng Premium at Flex Plan. Anuman ang pipiliin mo, tinutulungan ng Qiskit Serverless na gawing simple ang execution at i-parallelize ang mga bahagi ng iyong workflow.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Visit the [Qiskit Functions templates](/guides/qiskit-function-templates) guide to learn more, or read an overview of [Qiskit Functions](/guides/functions) in the documentation.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Second quarter\">\n"
msgstr ""
"Bisitahin ang gabay na [Qiskit Functions templates](/guides/qiskit-function-templates) para matuto pa, o basahin ang overview ng [Qiskit Functions](/guides/functions) sa dokumentasyon.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Ikalawang quarter\">\n"

#. type: Title ####
