msgid "5 June 2025 {#5-june-2025}"
msgstr "5 Hunyo 2025 {#5-june-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "We're excited to roll out two new functions for finance and optimization:\n"
msgstr "Excited kaming maglabas ng dalawang bagong function para sa finance at optimization:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[QUICK-PDE](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions?id=colibritd-quick-pde) by ColibriTD allows users to solve certain differential equations for material deformation and computational fluid dynamics problems. For example, one team of researchers has already begun using the QUICK-PDE function to study the dynamics of novel reactive fluids developed to transfer heat more efficiently in a type of nuclear reactor known as Small Modular Reactors.\n"
msgstr "[QUICK-PDE](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions?id=colibritd-quick-pde) ng ColibriTD ay nagbibigay-daan sa mga user na lutasin ang ilang differential equation para sa material deformation at mga problema sa computational fluid dynamics. Halimbawa, isang team ng mga mananaliksik ang nagsimula nang gumamit ng QUICK-PDE function para pag-aralan ang dynamics ng mga bagong reactive fluid na binuo upang mas episyenteng maglipat ng init sa isang uri ng nuclear reactor na kilala bilang Small Modular Reactors.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Quantum Portfolio Optimizer](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions?id=global-data-quantum-quantum-portfolio-optimizer) by Global Data Quantum enables quantitative finance researchers to back-test portfolio optimization strategies. Running on over 100 qubits, this function calculates a portfolio's Sharpe ratio versus return across a specified time period. Early users are exploring the optimizer's ability to evaluate historical performance of an investment strategy and to enable comparisons of different portfolios under similar conditions.\n"
msgstr "[Quantum Portfolio Optimizer](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions?id=global-data-quantum-quantum-portfolio-optimizer) ng Global Data Quantum ay nagbibigay-daan sa mga mananaliksik sa quantitative finance na mag-back-test ng mga estratehiya sa portfolio optimization. Tumatakbo sa mahigit 100 qubit, kinakalkula ng function na ito ang Sharpe ratio ng isang portfolio kumpara sa return sa loob ng tinukoy na tagal ng panahon. Ang mga unang user ay sinusuri ang kakayahan ng optimizer na tasahin ang historical performance ng isang investment strategy at magbigay-daan sa paghahambing ng iba't ibang portfolio sa magkatulad na kondisyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check out the [Qiskit Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) to request a free trial today.\n"
msgstr "Tingnan ang [Qiskit Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) para humiling ng libreng trial ngayon.\n"

